---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { STATUS, BOARD } from '../consts';
---
<PageLayout
  title="About"
  heading="About Thinker's Foundation"
  intro="Thinkers helping thinkers: a small organization being formed to look after open-source building blocks and the people who use them.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Where things stand</h2>
    <p>{STATUS} Nothing on this site describes a finished organization.</p>
    <h2>What it is for</h2>
    <p>The aim is a long-lived home for open-source building blocks, and for the people who make things with them, that does not depend on one person&rsquo;s laptop or goodwill. The projects it expects to support today are <a class="link" href="https://www.thinkersjournal.com">Thinker&rsquo;s Journal</a> and the open-source libraries and tools published at <a class="link" href="https://github.com/ThinkersJournal">github.com/ThinkersJournal</a>.</p>
    <h2>Who is behind it</h2>
    {BOARD.length === 0
      ? <p>The founder, alone for now. Directors and officers will be listed on this page once each has agreed to be named.</p>
      : <ul>{BOARD.map((b) => <li>{b.name}, {b.role}</li>)}</ul>}
    <h2>How to reach it</h2>
    <p>See the <a class="link" href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
<style>
  .prose{max-width:66ch}
  .prose h2{font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,28px);margin:36px 0 4px}
  .prose h2:first-of-type{margin-top:8px}
  .prose p,.prose li{color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;margin:14px 0 0}
  .prose ul{list-style:none}
</style>
